# Reviewed Trivy exceptions for the container job (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
# The job fails on HIGH and CRITICAL findings that have a fix. An entry here silences one
# finding for both images, so each needs, on the line above it:
#   - why it does not apply (the vulnerable code is not reachable in the image) or why it
#     cannot be fixed yet,
#   - the date it was reviewed,
#   - the condition that removes it (a fixed base image or dependency).
# Prefer fixing: bump the base image digest in the Dockerfile or the dependency. The gate test
# scripts/__tests__/ci-workflow.gate.test.ts fails on an entry without such a comment.
#
# Format: one id per line (CVE-YYYY-NNNN), a trailing `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` makes it expire.
#
# No exceptions at review time (2026-10-17, Trivy v0.75.0): both images scan clean.
